error[org/setupfile]: `#+SETUPFILE` isn't read: an Entry is one file
 --> errors.org:1:1
  |
1 | #+SETUPFILE: "../setup.org"
  | ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
  |
  = help: put shared settings where yuanme reads them: `#+OPTIONS` in each file, LaTeX macros in `[math]` in yuanme.toml, and styles, scripts and analytics in Templates
  = note: run `yuanme docs org/setupfile` for more
error[org/unsupported-construct]: `#+INCLUDE` keywords aren't in the Org subset
 --> errors.org:2:1
