error[org/unsupported-construct]: dynamic blocks aren't in the Org subset
  --> errors.org:10:1
   |
10 | / #+BEGIN: clocktable
11 | | | a |
12 | | #+END:
   | |______^
   |
   = help: dynamic blocks are filled in by Emacs; paste in what it wrote and remove the `#+BEGIN:` and `#+END:` lines
   = note: run `yuanme docs org/unsupported-construct` for more
error[org/invalid-attribute]: `class=wide` isn't an attribute name
  --> errors.org:14:14
   |
14 | #+ATTR_HTML: class=wide
   |              ^^^^^^^^^^
   |
   = help: write each attribute as `:name value`, such as `#+ATTR_HTML: :class wide :width 300`
